  "definition_ja": "分数式を、分母の因数ごとの簡単な分数式の和に分けること。",
  "definition_en": "Rewriting a rational expression as a sum of simpler fractions, one for each factor of the denominator.",
  "latex": "\\frac{1}{x(x+1)} = \\frac{1}{x} - \\frac{1}{x+1}",
  "spoken_en": "one over x times x plus one equals one over x minus one over x plus one",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "The denominator factors, so let's do partial fractions.",
      "ja": "分母が因数分解できるから、部分分数に分けよう。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "The partial fraction decomposition of 1/(x² − 1) is (1/2)/(x − 1) − (1/2)/(x + 1).",
      "ja": "1/(x² − 1) を部分分数分解すると (1/2)/(x − 1) − (1/2)/(x + 1) となる。",
